    will triple the win, and 2 <sprite=0> symbols in a non-jackpot winning combination
    will pay 9\xD7 the win.\n<sprite=1>is wild for Seven and BAR symbols, except
    when three <sprite=1> symbols appear on a payline.\n1 <sprite=1> in a non-jackpot
    winning combination will double the win, and 2 <sprite=1> symbols in a non-jackpot
    winning combination will pay 4\xD7 the win.\n1 <sprite=0> and 1 <sprite=1> in
